# Input

```css
.b{content:attr( data-label );width:attr(data-size px ,2px);height:attr(data-height type(<length>),2px);padding:attr(data-gap px,var(--fallback,2px));}
.empty{content:attr(data-label,);width:attr(data-size px,/* empty */);}

```


# Formatted

```css
.b {
	content: attr(data-label);
	width: attr(data-size px, 2px);
	height: attr(data-height type(<length>), 2px);
	padding: attr(data-gap px, var(--fallback, 2px));
}
.empty {
	content: attr(data-label, );
	width: attr(data-size px, /* empty */);
}

```
